}

// THE TWO KNOWN REDS ARE DECLARED, NOT OMITTED. A roster that silently drops what it cannot pass
// reports full coverage over a subset, which is worse than reporting the gap. Both are run, and the
// run FAILS if either one PASSES -- a stale quarantine is a defect in the roster, exactly as it is
