data witness_ci_economics_frontier: PrivateWitness = PrivateWitness {
  entry: "dag/test/claim/ci_economics_frontier_witness_test.dag",
  function: "economics_frontier_quarantine_main",
  disposition: KnownRed {
    expected_causes: [
      "error: witness_frontier_drops_only_dominated_candidates=FAIL",
      "error: witness_system_lots_enter_frontier_honestly=FAIL",
      "error: witness_cheapest_and_densest_are_both_worse_per_unit=FAIL",
      "error: witness_memory_price_curve_has_a_cliff=FAIL",
    ],
    reason: "The pricing/spill/page join is Enforced as witness_ci_economics. The node-build Pareto controls still print the four FAIL lines below (run 34763198395). Each roster body is its own line; only FAIL lines carry error:, so a new red body is UNDECLARED FAILURE and a repaired body is CAUSE DRIFT. Arming the old single entry as Enforced by shrinking it to the pricing bodies would have discharged a restoration trigger while executing less than the roster it named.",
    restoration_trigger: "economics_frontier_main returns ExitSuccess against public main because the complete ci_economics_witness_roster is green, then this row becomes Enforced and its RosterOutcome joins test.claim.private_roster_witness.",
  },
}

data witness_strategy: PrivateWitness = PrivateWitness {
  entry: "dag/test/claim/strategy_witness_test.dag",
  function: "strategy_witness_main",
  disposition: KnownRed {
    expected_causes: [
      "error: witness_every_active_roadmap_lane_has_strategic_reason=FAIL",
      "error: witness_capability_evidence_consistent_with_public_authority=FAIL",
    ],
    reason: "TWO CAUSES, BOTH WITNESS VERDICTS, NOT RESOLVE FAILURES, AND FOR DIFFERENT KINDS OF REASON. The module resolves: std.currency was RENAMED to extdeps.currency.currency in public #9641 (2026-08-28), not deleted, and both importers now bind the successor, which retires the previous resolve causes in the same change that eliminates them. strategy_witness_main now evaluates every test fn in the module and prints one line per body, so this row is cause-locked at witness grain: a second red body is an UNDECLARED FAILURE, and this body going green is CAUSE DRIFT. Measured on public 01a6abe9bb3 and again on 2b992baa25b: this body returns false on two conjuncts -- nine owners of active PUBLIC roadmap nodes carry neither a lane binding nor an acknowledgement in strategy.gunbc_strategy, and one binding names an owner the public roadmap no longer has. Those bindings are operator strategy content and are not edited here. THIS WITNESS READS A LIVE PUBLIC POPULATION: gunbc.roadmap_authority active_roadmap_nodes_projection over public main, so it re-reds whenever a public roadmap owner is added, renamed or removed, independent of any private change. That cross-repo coupling is a class of its own; its home is the dashboard lane adhoc-17431978-5ae, and this row is one instance of it rather than its resolution. SECOND CAUSE, AN ABSENT PUBLIC AUTHORITY: witness_capability_evidence_consistent_with_public_authority refuses by construction while test.claim.strategy_witness public_accepted_roadmap_set is AcceptedSetUnavailable -- public gunbc#11310 deleted accepted_roadmap_node_ids_projection at the root, so the join of observed capability evidence against the public accepted roadmap node set cannot run, and the arm fails closed rather than reporting a green for a join it did not perform. Nothing here is fixable in private content; the always-checkable half runs green as witness_observed_capability_ids_are_declared.",
    restoration_trigger: "Each cause retires by its own trigger and the row becomes Enforced only when both have fired. FIRST CAUSE: the operator's lane bindings and acknowledgements in strategy.gunbc_strategy cover the live public roadmap owner set -- every owner active_roadmap_nodes_projection projects is bound or acknowledged, and every bound owner exists there -- so witness_every_active_roadmap_lane_has_strategic_reason returns true; then this row becomes Enforced in the same change. Because that owner set is live, the restoration is durable only once the cross-repo coupling home (adhoc-17431978-5ae) gives this private consumer a pinned or change-notified view of it. SECOND CAUSE: a public authority again projects the accepted roadmap node id set and resolves in this closure, public_accepted_roadmap_set takes its AcceptedSetProjected arm, and witness_capability_evidence_consistent_with_public_authority returns true on the join it names.",
  },
}

